# Supabase project settings — Dashboard → Project Settings → API (or "Connect").
# Use the Project URL and the *publishable* key (sb_publishable_…) or the legacy
# "anon" key. NEVER put the service_role / secret key here: these values are
# compiled into the app.
#
# Leave them empty to run the app with the offline mock login.
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
